## Third-party model: DINOv3

This package's backbone is Meta's DINOv3 ConvNeXt (`facebookresearch/dinov3`,
loaded via `torch.hub`). DINOv3 is governed by its own licence from Meta, not
by AGPL-3.0 — see https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3 for its terms.

The backbone checkpoint (`dinov3_convnext_{small,base,large}_pretrain_lvd1689m*.pth`)
is a **gated download from Meta**. It is not distributed in this repository,
is never fetched automatically by any code here, and must be downloaded
directly from Meta by whoever runs this package — see `cropcounter.weights`
or the README's install section for the exact steps.

The decoder checkpoint that this repository or its releases may ship under
`weights/` is InsightML's own trained head. It contains no Meta tensors or
weights, was trained from scratch on top of the frozen (and separately
downloaded) DINOv3 backbone, and is provided under AGPL-3.0 like the rest of
this repository.

Anyone deploying this package together with the DINOv3 backbone is
responsible for complying with **both** licences in that deployment: AGPL-3.0
for `cropcounter` and its decoder weights, and Meta's DINOv3 licence for the
backbone.

In short: our trained weights are in the repo; the base model comes from
Meta under their own licence.

